      <text>ALG2_U01_L06_Q15</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U01_L06_Q15</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.PF.7</p><p>What is the first step that best preserves all solutions when solving x&#179; - 16x = 0?</p>]]></text>
