        <text><![CDATA[This can lose the solution x = 0.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Take the cube root of 16]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The equation has two terms with x and should be factored.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Add 16 to both sides]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This does not isolate or factor the polynomial correctly.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Factor out x]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Correct. Factoring gives x(x squared - 16) = 0 and keeps x = 0 visible.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
