    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U01_L06_Q16</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.PF.7</p><p>If x = 4 is a zero of a polynomial, which linear factor is associated with that zero?</p>]]></text>
